'''Elemental Switch''' (Japanese: '''エレメンタルつけかえ''' ''Elemental Replacement'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Move a {{e|Fire}}, {{e|Water}}, or {{e|Lightning}} Energy from 1 of your Benched Pokémon to your Active Pokémon.
}}

