==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to the effect of {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Multi Switch|129}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card can only move {{e|Fire}}, {{e|Water}}, or {{e|Lightning}} Energy.
** {{TCGP|Dawn}} can move any Energy (like Multi Switch) but is a Supporter card.

